# ============================================================================
# SimpleWalls.map  -  the room walls for the MTRX3760 Lab 2 wall-following
# example. 
#
# A single named closed loop, "room": the walls the robot follows. It is a
# rectangle with a notch cut into the top edge, giving one inside corner (at
# the notch) as well as the outside corners. The starting pose sits near the
# top left, facing right along the top wall.
#
# Coordinates are in the space the renderer draws in (x right, y down, in an
# 800 x 600 window); headings are in degrees clockwise from +x. The file
# format (loop / startpose / vertex) is described at the top of CLoopReader.h.
# ============================================================================

loop room
    startpose 150 140 90
    vertex 100 100
    vertex 400 100
    vertex 400 200
    vertex 700 200
    vertex 700 500
    vertex 100 500
